{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1792563752385953462,"compiled_state":{"alias":"wanted-clotty-bovine","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"92b54c507204a333c3a5c20858439dc2e710e79378bca50a1fa7af013c5486c3","event_uuid":"ca031c47-f4c6-4248-bfd6-d16e66d891b3","position":{"commit_sha":"e1592f0d87c48c712d13b310ee44856df2144902","position":"1792559825793810955-ca031c47-f4c6-4248-bfd6-d16e66d891b3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"5a4099b674130f686b668aeb063c6f29cd972ae8f7616bf1c0f78d21e341f137","event_uuid":"bd66614b-7fdf-45e7-9881-ade2e114a316","position":{"commit_sha":"9a264c784e6a4f37f387053720e34e123133d5ea","position":"1792559843985000398-bd66614b-7fdf-45e7-9881-ade2e114a316"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1792559825793810955,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"bd66614b-7fdf-45e7-9881-ade2e114a316","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"bf96-5776-6a97-420f"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\n`tests/unit/test_repo_isolation_guard.py::test_a_transient_probe_stall_is_re_sampled_rather_than_reported` failed once in a local `make verify` on 2026-10-21 PDT (lane ebf5, tree 155238156af = origin/main ca042ec0f49 plus change 3056 patch set 3): `assert int(state.read_text()) == 3` got 4 (`tests/unit/test_repo_isolation_guard.py:182`). The run was `1 failed, 19791 passed, 87 skipped` at host load average 11-16 with other lanes' suites running. Neither the test nor `tests/_isolation.py` differs from origin/main in that tree; the same code tree (patch set 2, 0e63a6d135e) passed `make verify` with 0 failures, and the test then passed 8 of 8 isolated runs (two of them took ~50 s each, the rest ~1.3 s).\n\nThe test sets `_isolation.GIT_PROBE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS = 0.5` and counts git invocations through a blocking-git shim that stalls exactly one sample. Hypothesis (unproven): under host load an un-stalled sample also exceeds the 0.5 s per-attempt bound, so the guard re-samples it too and the count becomes 4. Alternatives: the shim's state counter races between invocations; the first `head()` call itself retried.\n\n## Approach\nReproduce deterministically (constrain CPU, e.g. run the test under `nice` with a parallel CPU burner bounded by `perl -e 'alarm N'`, or inject a slow first sample in the shim), confirm which sample retried from the shim's own log, then make the assertion express the contract (\"the stalled sample was re-sampled and HEAD was not reported changed\") without depending on wall-clock headroom for the healthy samples, e.g. assert the stalled sample was retried and `after == before`, and count retries per sample rather than total invocations.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A deterministic reproduction of the 4-invocation outcome is recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] The test passes 20 consecutive runs under the same induced load and still fails if the guard reports a transient stall as a HEAD change.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"b4e1-754d-17b8-40b9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"test_a_transient_probe_stall_is_re_sampled_rather_than_reported fails under full-suite host load (git invoked 4 times, expected 3)","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["ca031c47-f4c6-4248-bfd6-d16e66d891b3","bd66614b-7fdf-45e7-9881-ade2e114a316"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1792563752385953462,"uuid":"2cf1129a-713d-46e7-b026-fdaf884a27da"}